# Copy to .env at the repo root. `just net up <id>` copies the keys listed under
# `env_keys` in dpi-network.yaml into each device's ~/.dpi/backend.env.
#
# Model auth is the Pi grok-cli login on the machine that runs dpi-backend
# (~/.pi/grok-cli/accounts.json). A local device needs no key in this file.
#
# Optional override of that vault. Add the name to `env_keys` to copy it onto a device.
# GROK_CLI_OAUTH_TOKEN=
